{
  "work_id": "coptic-scriptorium/life_cyrus",
  "source_path": "coptic-scriptorium/life_cyrus.json",
  "source_language": "cop",
  "target_language": "eng",
  "provenance": {
    "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12": {
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol",
      "prompt_version": "bulk-2026-10-12",
      "date": "2026-10-12",
      "script": "scripts.embed_eval.translate"
    },
    "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14": {
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol",
      "prompt_version": "bulk-2026-10-12",
      "date": "2026-10-14",
      "script": "__main__"
    }
  },
  "translations": [
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/life_cyrus#CopScr.life-cyrus.000.0000",
      "source_sha256": "08dd6e688e729a09",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "The life and conduct of our holy father, honored in every way, Saint Apa Cyrus, the truly perfect man, as recorded by Apa Pambo, the priest of the church of Scetis. Saint Apa Cyrus entered his rest on the eighth day of the month of Epiphi, in the peace of God."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/life_cyrus#CopScr.life-cyrus.000.0001",
      "source_sha256": "f74567d71df75d3c",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "May his holy blessing come down upon us, and may we be saved. Amen."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/life_cyrus#CopScr.life-cyrus.000.0002",
      "source_sha256": "231de61c5931812e",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Now this happened in the time of Apa Pambo, the priest of the church of Scetis, after he had buried the body of the blessed Hilaria, the daughter of Emperor Zeno."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/life_cyrus#CopScr.life-cyrus.000.0003",
      "source_sha256": "271147ccd8735917",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 15,
      "text": "A vision was revealed to him, saying, “Get up and go toward the ocean.”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/life_cyrus#CopScr.life-cyrus.000.0004",
      "source_sha256": "e928d0aca1792f01",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "You will find a great hermit of whom the whole world is not worthy of a single sandal strap on his feet."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/life_cyrus#CopScr.life-cyrus.000.0005",
      "source_sha256": "5d29d2038c72a26a",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "The blessed Apa Pambo got up and walked into the mountain through the power of God, who was with him, just as he was with the blessed Anthony when he traveled to the blessed Apa Paul the Second."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/life_cyrus#CopScr.life-cyrus.000.0006",
      "source_sha256": "2dc43964aa05f78d",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "The blessed Apa Pambo, the priest, got up and walked into the desert."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/life_cyrus#CopScr.life-cyrus.000.0007",
      "source_sha256": "e5a13cdd06d844b5",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "He came upon a dwelling."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/life_cyrus#CopScr.life-cyrus.000.0008",
      "source_sha256": "b3f5740b9142e69b",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 15,
      "text": "He stood up and knocked at the door for an hour, to no avail."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/life_cyrus#CopScr.life-cyrus.000.0009",
      "source_sha256": "3b6295a9da0abf82",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "He called out three times, according to the rule of the monastic brothers, saying, “Bless me.”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/life_cyrus#CopScr.life-cyrus.000.0010",
      "source_sha256": "922e0926b5340990",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "While I, Pambo, was still standing at the door, the brother answered me from inside, saying, “Greetings, Pambo, priest of the church of Scetis, the great ship sailing through the waterless desert."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/life_cyrus#CopScr.life-cyrus.000.0011",
      "source_sha256": "da45e31b3710d677",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "For a long time I have wanted to see you."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/life_cyrus#CopScr.life-cyrus.000.0012",
      "source_sha256": "fbbacef020998940",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Look, God has fulfilled my wish today."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/life_cyrus#CopScr.life-cyrus.000.0013",
      "source_sha256": "e81ce9c3a6228d80",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Come in, blessed man.”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/life_cyrus#CopScr.life-cyrus.000.0014",
      "source_sha256": "31b28aa6edb41eec",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Apa Pambo answered, saying, “Greetings, Apa Hierax, who has become a companion of God's angels because of his purity.”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/life_cyrus#CopScr.life-cyrus.000.0015",
      "source_sha256": "fc4d4e8ec12dc8ae",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Then Apa Hierax opened the door and brought him inside, and they sat down together."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/life_cyrus#CopScr.life-cyrus.000.0016",
      "source_sha256": "60bc3d9f1ee14d22",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Apa Pambo said to him, “My dear brother Apa Hierax, how many years has it been since you came into this place?”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/life_cyrus#CopScr.life-cyrus.000.0017",
      "source_sha256": "54116ed80387b8fa",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "He said, “I have been in this place for eighteen years, and I have eaten no food belonging to this world. Instead, I live on the fruit of the trees.”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/life_cyrus#CopScr.life-cyrus.000.0018",
      "source_sha256": "d9d7a0576fa5d9b9",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "There was a date palm growing outside his dwelling, producing twelve clusters, one cluster each month."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/life_cyrus#CopScr.life-cyrus.000.0019",
      "source_sha256": "952115847246ddcb",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "He lived on its fruit."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/life_cyrus#CopScr.life-cyrus.000.0020",
      "source_sha256": "89d871540a6b3c80",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "I, Pambo, said to him, “My dear father, is there a brother farther in than you?”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/life_cyrus#CopScr.life-cyrus.000.0021",
      "source_sha256": "63ac44f6a5b4c9b3",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "He said to me, “There are."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/life_cyrus#CopScr.life-cyrus.000.0022",
      "source_sha256": "55d8959f1d2ca1a1",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Bless me, and go to them and receive a blessing from them.”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/life_cyrus#CopScr.life-cyrus.000.0023",
      "source_sha256": "6a3f7c91745f5836",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "When I left him and walked into the mountain, I came upon a small dwelling."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/life_cyrus#CopScr.life-cyrus.000.0024",
      "source_sha256": "7a3349c95b3d4585",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "I called inside according to the rule of the monastic brothers."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/life_cyrus#CopScr.life-cyrus.000.0025",
      "source_sha256": "50e36f5e8c81443a",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "While I was still standing outside, the brother answered me from inside, saying, “Greetings, Apa Pambo, priest of the church of Scetis, and the great ship sailing through the waterless desert."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/life_cyrus#CopScr.life-cyrus.000.0026",
      "source_sha256": "6a7055306942786b",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "For many days I have wanted to see you."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/life_cyrus#CopScr.life-cyrus.000.0027",
      "source_sha256": "e4970fa37d4b62d1",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "At last, the Lord has fulfilled my wish for me today."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/life_cyrus#CopScr.life-cyrus.000.0028",
      "source_sha256": "5ddbff05207e12de",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Come inside; do not stand outside."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/life_cyrus#CopScr.life-cyrus.000.0029",
      "source_sha256": "f86c12b05a009ac4",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "I, Pambo, answered him, “My beloved father, Apa Pamoun the Naked, sir,”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/life_cyrus#CopScr.life-cyrus.000.0030",
      "source_sha256": "a352e8c001677c03",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "“Greetings, my beloved brother, wearer of a multicolored tunic like the tunic of Joseph the righteous.”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/life_cyrus#CopScr.life-cyrus.000.0031",
      "source_sha256": "46a9c1d8b1b6dee3",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "But in God's sight it is more precious than any royal purple robe in this world."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/life_cyrus#CopScr.life-cyrus.000.0032",
      "source_sha256": "f7a2956f53d8d695",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Believe me, my brothers and my fathers: I, Pambo, the least of all, smelled that brother's fragrance from a mile away, before I reached him."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/life_cyrus#CopScr.life-cyrus.000.0033",
      "source_sha256": "dc0f07afa74d0dd5",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "After we greeted one another, we prayed and sat down."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/life_cyrus#CopScr.life-cyrus.000.0034",
      "source_sha256": "50f86bbab4da881f",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "I said to him, “My father, then do you not get cold in winter or scorched in summer, wearing a tunic like this?”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/life_cyrus#CopScr.life-cyrus.000.0035",
      "source_sha256": "4bfe24047c6cd21b",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Apa Pamoun the Naked—for this alone was his name—said to me, “My beloved brother, Apa Pambo,”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/life_cyrus#CopScr.life-cyrus.000.0036",
      "source_sha256": "9ed53ea4f662d580",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "“Believe me, my beloved father: for twenty years, ever since I came to this place, this one garment is what I have found keeps me warm in winter and in the different temperature of the air in summer.”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/life_cyrus#CopScr.life-cyrus.000.0037",
      "source_sha256": "44baf423822e1c48",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "“And I tell you that this will be enough for me until the day of my death.”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/life_cyrus#CopScr.life-cyrus.000.0038",
      "source_sha256": "b801994f0fff95d6",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "“And at my death, too, it will be enough for me, and they will wrap me in it until the day of the true judgment.”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/life_cyrus#CopScr.life-cyrus.000.0039",
      "source_sha256": "3d3159e790533808",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "I said to him, “My beloved father, is there a brother farther inside than you?”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/life_cyrus#CopScr.life-cyrus.000.0040",
      "source_sha256": "20feeb5217aa39bb",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 15,
      "text": "He said to me, “Yes, there is someone there whose single sandal strap the whole world is not worthy of.”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/life_cyrus#CopScr.life-cyrus.000.0041",
      "source_sha256": "89fb7c1ed0110fbd",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "“I have gone to him many times, wanting to greet him.”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/life_cyrus#CopScr.life-cyrus.000.0042",
      "source_sha256": "53357fcd5e72bcd2",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "“And he would answer me from inside, saying, ‘Stop troubling yourself by coming here,”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/life_cyrus#CopScr.life-cyrus.000.0043",
      "source_sha256": "c2160066bad85e4c",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "“‘because no person of flesh can see my face except the priest of the church of Scetis.’”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/life_cyrus#CopScr.life-cyrus.000.0044",
      "source_sha256": "878b49e041839c32",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "“But now, my father, perhaps it is ordained that I should go with you, see him, and receive a blessing from him before I die.”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/life_cyrus#CopScr.life-cyrus.000.0045",
      "source_sha256": "b06ba28a2f78ad0f",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "I said to him, “No, this is not ordained. Indeed, that is why I came to you here.”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/life_cyrus#CopScr.life-cyrus.000.0046",
      "source_sha256": "56eae394b9670dbc",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "“But I will remember you if the Lord makes my path straight and I meet that brother.”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/life_cyrus#CopScr.life-cyrus.000.0047",
      "source_sha256": "ef4d124e8f22dd17",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "“Only, my father, remember me until I receive that brother's blessing.”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/life_cyrus#CopScr.life-cyrus.000.0048",
      "source_sha256": "41cda744651ac040",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "When I had walked more than a mile farther into the mountain, I—I, Pambo, the least of all—swear to you by God's fearsome judgment seat that I am not lying in what I am about to say now: the one who seized the prophet Habakkuk long ago and brought him, along with the meal in his hands, carrying him to the lions' den and giving it to Daniel in the lions' den,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/life_cyrus#CopScr.life-cyrus.000.0049",
      "source_sha256": "db5f7fdb1833b026",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "was also the one who seized me through the impulse of the Spirit and brought me to that brother's dwelling."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/life_cyrus#CopScr.life-cyrus.000.0050",
      "source_sha256": "fedd75e0fd25bb20",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "I knocked on the door according to the rule of the monastic brothers, and I stood at the door for a long time."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/life_cyrus#CopScr.life-cyrus.000.0051",
      "source_sha256": "f3e4b7782ba365a8",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "After this, the brother answered me from inside, saying, “Greetings, Apa Pambo, priest of the church of Scetis, and great ship sailing in the waterless desert.”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/life_cyrus#CopScr.life-cyrus.000.0052",
      "source_sha256": "06cdd9aba3197fa4",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "“For many days I have longed to see you.”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/life_cyrus#CopScr.life-cyrus.000.0053",
      "source_sha256": "1c93308c7daedeb4",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Look, God has fulfilled my wish for me today."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/life_cyrus#CopScr.life-cyrus.000.0054",
      "source_sha256": "7ee54f77273964d8",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Come inside; do not stand outside."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/life_cyrus#CopScr.life-cyrus.000.0055",
      "source_sha256": "d0586b1c331c8d2a",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "When I entered the doorway of the cell, I looked and saw a large stone that twelve men could barely lift and carry."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/life_cyrus#CopScr.life-cyrus.000.0056",
      "source_sha256": "2fd834bb8892b83d",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "That brother went forward, rolled the stone, and set it against the doorway of the cell."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/life_cyrus#CopScr.life-cyrus.000.0057",
      "source_sha256": "48577aee687ebd64",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "When I saw him, I was utterly amazed."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/life_cyrus#CopScr.life-cyrus.000.0058",
      "source_sha256": "eede1dde2f37776b",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "But I remembered the patriarch Jacob, who likewise, when he fled from his brother Esau, went to Mesopotamia in Syria and came to the place where Laban’s sheep were."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/life_cyrus#CopScr.life-cyrus.000.0059",
      "source_sha256": "390823a85db525ee",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "He went forward to the well and rolled away the stone over its mouth without anyone helping him. He watered Laban’s sheep and let them go out to graze."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/life_cyrus#CopScr.life-cyrus.000.0060",
      "source_sha256": "543e872487472c90",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Then I understood this: God helps the saints in everything they do."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/life_cyrus#CopScr.life-cyrus.000.0061",
      "source_sha256": "fbb9cf1ab76de463",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "I said to him, “My holy father, tell me your holy name, for the Lord has hidden it from me.”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/life_cyrus#CopScr.life-cyrus.000.0062",
      "source_sha256": "36e1cfb29ba66d5b",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "He said, “My name is Cyrus."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/life_cyrus#CopScr.life-cyrus.000.0063",
      "source_sha256": "c08806628017fdeb",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "I am the brother of Emperor Theodosius, and I was brought up with Arcadius and Honorius, sharing the same table with them. Indeed, Honorius often said to me, ‘Take me into the wilderness with you so that I may become a monk.’"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/life_cyrus#CopScr.life-cyrus.000.0064",
      "source_sha256": "b4a08fdc5a002062",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 15,
      "text": "But I could not receive him, because he is the king’s son."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/life_cyrus#CopScr.life-cyrus.000.0065",
      "source_sha256": "1cd1446f98c78204",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "But when we saw that oppression had increased, that kings were acting lawlessly, that rulers were oppressing the poor, and that everyone had turned aside and corrupted their way before God, I got up, left, and came to this desert. I have lived here because of my many sins,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/life_cyrus#CopScr.life-cyrus.000.0066",
      "source_sha256": "ef3aa2aecfa2d80e",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "so that God may forgive them for me.”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/life_cyrus#CopScr.life-cyrus.000.0067",
      "source_sha256": "035e65568323de39",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "I, Pambo, said to him, “My beloved father, where do you find someone in this wilderness to comfort you in your hardships?”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/life_cyrus#CopScr.life-cyrus.000.0068",
      "source_sha256": "45bfd5d016e23b45",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Apa Cyrus said to me, “Believe me, my beloved brother Apa Pambo: my God and my Lord Jesus Christ is the one who visits me in this desert where I live."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/life_cyrus#CopScr.life-cyrus.000.0069",
      "source_sha256": "de67a99c463877b2",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "For I have not seen anyone coming to me except a brother, a monk, who kept coming to me, wanting to see my face. Yet even he did not see me."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/life_cyrus#CopScr.life-cyrus.000.0070",
      "source_sha256": "4c7453843abd7ee6",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "But because he persisted in coming to me, I instructed him from inside, saying, ‘Stop troubling yourself by coming to me."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/life_cyrus#CopScr.life-cyrus.000.0071",
      "source_sha256": "6c1fb77f08dc589c",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "For no mortal can see my face except Apa Pambo, the priest of the church of Scetis,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/life_cyrus#CopScr.life-cyrus.001.0000",
      "source_sha256": "c60f674413e58942",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "since this matter has been ordained by God’s providence.’"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/life_cyrus#CopScr.life-cyrus.001.0001",
      "source_sha256": "55d70cb94b9fdd03",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Now, look, God has fulfilled my wish for me today.”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/life_cyrus#CopScr.life-cyrus.001.0002",
      "source_sha256": "0e4ecf8b7ed25e98",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "I said to him, “Then, my brother, is there a brother inside with you?”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/life_cyrus#CopScr.life-cyrus.001.0003",
      "source_sha256": "c5dfe7af99a8a424",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "He said to me, “There is nothing inside with me except the darkness and the punishments in which sinners find themselves."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/life_cyrus#CopScr.life-cyrus.001.0004",
      "source_sha256": "3978ded0f66f9cf0",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Sit here, my brother, for now, and you will see great wonders.”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/life_cyrus#CopScr.life-cyrus.001.0005",
      "source_sha256": "2bceda68373da7ab",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "For it was the night before Sunday. When the light of Sunday began to spread,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/life_cyrus#CopScr.life-cyrus.001.0006",
      "source_sha256": "432b19e2036fa4a6",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "I heard voices crying out, “Your love is welcome, O Christ, for you have had mercy on us.”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/life_cyrus#CopScr.life-cyrus.001.0007",
      "source_sha256": "1385a014118899e2",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "I said to him, “My beloved father, what are we to do about this?"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/life_cyrus#CopScr.life-cyrus.001.0008",
      "source_sha256": "09fa15f60f9250cd",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "The mountain is going to rumble beneath us.”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/life_cyrus#CopScr.life-cyrus.001.0009",
      "source_sha256": "e93c55affa9f158e",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "He said to me, “Do not be afraid, my son. God has come down to the places of punishment."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/life_cyrus#CopScr.life-cyrus.001.0010",
      "source_sha256": "07632a7dbce56dcf",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "He has ordered the tormentors who afflict the souls to give them rest, because today is the Lord’s Day and the resurrection of the Lord.”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/life_cyrus#CopScr.life-cyrus.001.0011",
      "source_sha256": "072666be5897e40d",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "He said to me again, “Christ must come to this place today, as is his custom, so that I may kiss him mouth to mouth.”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/life_cyrus#CopScr.life-cyrus.001.0012",
      "source_sha256": "7bacddbc201ba288",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "While he was still saying these things, behold, Christ opened the door of the cell and came in. Immediately the door opened by itself."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/life_cyrus#CopScr.life-cyrus.001.0013",
      "source_sha256": "8738486014cc02ac",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "When he came in—believe me, my brothers and my fathers—I, Pambo, the least of all, saw Christ approach that brother and kiss him lip to lip, like a brother who had returned from a foreign land and met his companion."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/life_cyrus#CopScr.life-cyrus.001.0014",
      "source_sha256": "6993c74f386d2a3c",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "But I, Pambo, the least of all, was not worthy to have him kiss me at that time. Instead, he left us, and we did not know where he had gone."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/life_cyrus#CopScr.life-cyrus.001.0015",
      "source_sha256": "4cc9e83d239b0b3e",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "I thought that he was a brother, a monk."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/life_cyrus#CopScr.life-cyrus.001.0016",
      "source_sha256": "21b747c5e1af5d73",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "I said to him, “My beloved father, did you not tell me, ‘I have never seen anyone in the flesh coming to me in this place except you alone’?"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/life_cyrus#CopScr.life-cyrus.001.0017",
      "source_sha256": "8d90fa6ba6dc6a9a",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "But tell me who this brother, this monk, is, who came in and kissed you, while I was not worthy to have him kiss me.”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/life_cyrus#CopScr.life-cyrus.001.0018",
      "source_sha256": "05a759a48a98e73e",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "He said to me, “Did you not recognize him?”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/life_cyrus#CopScr.life-cyrus.001.0019",
      "source_sha256": "a8c1927bd36f9699",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "I said to him, “No, my father. How could I recognize him?”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/life_cyrus#CopScr.life-cyrus.001.0020",
      "source_sha256": "9ecaa950072d57fb",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "He said to me, “This is the Lord of those in heaven and those on earth."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/life_cyrus#CopScr.life-cyrus.001.0021",
      "source_sha256": "78b4899fe535d692",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "This is the Son of Mary, the holy virgin."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/life_cyrus#CopScr.life-cyrus.001.0022",
      "source_sha256": "e5132a22fa57ccf1",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "This is the one who fills the desert and is with everyone who calls upon him.”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/life_cyrus#CopScr.life-cyrus.001.0023",
      "source_sha256": "b85f9ef22e654ad2",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "He said to me again, “A great prophet and archimandrite has passed away today: Apa Shenoute, the priest."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/life_cyrus#CopScr.life-cyrus.001.0024",
      "source_sha256": "64b00bd59f155236",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Truly, the whole world has lost a great teacher today.” For that day was the seventh of Epiph."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/life_cyrus#CopScr.life-cyrus.001.0025",
      "source_sha256": "b7ca3466c75b765a",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "He said to me again, “This is the man who never slept, never grew careless, and never took rest until he found a place for the Lord, a dwelling place for the God of Jacob, his helper."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/life_cyrus#CopScr.life-cyrus.001.0026",
      "source_sha256": "308e767643f61587",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Truly, he fought well and defeated the devil in the world. He went to stand before his [?] Lord, perfect in the kingdom of heaven."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/life_cyrus#CopScr.life-cyrus.001.0027",
      "source_sha256": "f7dd3756edacfc6f",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "May his blessings and his prayers be with us. Amen.”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/life_cyrus#CopScr.life-cyrus.001.0028",
      "source_sha256": "7f834f24ec8a54c1",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 15,
      "text": "He said to me again, “My beloved brother Pambo, I am ill today. Do me the kindness of praying for me until I pass along the road of fear and trembling.”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/life_cyrus#CopScr.life-cyrus.001.0029",
      "source_sha256": "d3ade7d1be0d074f",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 15,
      "text": "I said to him, “My beloved father, are you too afraid, after all the ascetic disciplines you have endured in the world?”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/life_cyrus#CopScr.life-cyrus.001.0030",
      "source_sha256": "6aae3aa377078e8d",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 15,
      "text": "He said to me, “As for ascetic disciplines, I performed a few in accordance with what God appointed for me. But why should we not be afraid, since we have been shown through many testimonies that a river of fire flows before the Judge?”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/life_cyrus#CopScr.life-cyrus.001.0031",
      "source_sha256": "ad38495f1993a6d5",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 15,
      "text": "“And everyone must cross that river, whether righteous or sinful. You should pray for me until I pass along that fearful road.”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/life_cyrus#CopScr.life-cyrus.001.0032",
      "source_sha256": "26b93ea49f840673",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 15,
      "text": "He also says, “Even if a person’s life on earth is only one day, he is not free from sin,” and again, “All flesh will be salted with fire.”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/life_cyrus#CopScr.life-cyrus.001.0033",
      "source_sha256": "5476862369ae6c64",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "At the third hour on the eighth of Epiph, his illness became worse."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/life_cyrus#CopScr.life-cyrus.001.0034",
      "source_sha256": "8cb42fe1f3d7719f",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "He said to me, “I greet you in the Lord, my beloved brother.” Then he prayed, reciting the prayer from the Gospel. He opened his mouth and gave up his spirit, like someone drifting off to sleep."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/life_cyrus#CopScr.life-cyrus.001.0035",
      "source_sha256": "3870e5bba0c20cb0",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "I sat and remained there weeping over him. While I was weeping over him, behold, Christ opened the door of the cell and came in. He stood over the body of the blessed Apa Cyrus and wept over him. I too wept over him."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/life_cyrus#CopScr.life-cyrus.001.0036",
      "source_sha256": "d5e5baf75a264875",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "I saw Christ’s tears fall upon the body of the blessed Apa Cyrus. Christ turned to me again and said, “Withdraw outside the door of the cell.”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/life_cyrus#CopScr.life-cyrus.001.0037",
      "source_sha256": "5df5e38eb0f5558f",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 12,
      "text": "When I took my leave of him, I saw a multitude of angels and archangels, together with the apostles and all the righteous, all gathered together and standing."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/life_cyrus#CopScr.life-cyrus.001.0038",
      "source_sha256": "8aaa57bd7bc82f29",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 15,
      "text": "One of them came toward me; he was a [?]."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/life_cyrus#CopScr.life-cyrus.001.0039",
      "source_sha256": "f5bfe2ff2875f048",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 12,
      "text": "He said to me, “Do you recognize who I am?”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/life_cyrus#CopScr.life-cyrus.001.0040",
      "source_sha256": "b5adac34f6dc8d64",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 12,
      "text": "I said to him, “No, my lord.” He said to me, “Listen, and I will tell you.”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/life_cyrus#CopScr.life-cyrus.001.0041",
      "source_sha256": "eebeb88058d679bb",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 12,
      "text": "“I am Cephas, who was named Peter.”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/life_cyrus#CopScr.life-cyrus.001.0042",
      "source_sha256": "acfeb1a744fd650c",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 12,
      "text": "“I am the one whom Christ called Bar-Jonah in the Gospel, which means ‘the son of the dove.’”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/life_cyrus#CopScr.life-cyrus.001.0043",
      "source_sha256": "88116eb5e73aa088",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 12,
      "text": "The blessed Apa Shenoute died yesterday."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/life_cyrus#CopScr.life-cyrus.001.0044",
      "source_sha256": "41215c3f8af26661",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 12,
      "text": "He took the soul of the blessed Apa Cyrus, together with Apa Shenoute the archimandrite, to the places of rest, as it is written: “There are many dwelling places in my Father’s house.”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/life_cyrus#CopScr.life-cyrus.001.0045",
      "source_sha256": "c9c69be85e8801fc",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 12,
      "text": "May their holy forms be with us. Amen."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/life_cyrus#CopScr.life-cyrus.001.0046",
      "source_sha256": "836d7cf2069e9a99",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 12,
      "text": "After this, I was troubled within myself, wondering how I would prepare the blessed man’s body, or where I would find a shroud to put on him. The Savior came out through the doorway of the chamber and closed the door."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/life_cyrus#CopScr.life-cyrus.001.0047",
      "source_sha256": "1e1645719a8c8673",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 15,
      "text": "The Savior stretched out his hand over the doorway of the lodging."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/life_cyrus#CopScr.life-cyrus.001.0048",
      "source_sha256": "23c52ccc0bf2126d",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 15,
      "text": "He wove over the body of the blessed man."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/life_cyrus#CopScr.life-cyrus.001.0049",
      "source_sha256": "2f5e0966449006e4",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 15,
      "text": "It became a shelter for him until the day of true judgment."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/life_cyrus#CopScr.life-cyrus.001.0050",
      "source_sha256": "5a2961d6aa1c59e9",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 15,
      "text": "The Savior went up to heaven with his angels."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/life_cyrus#CopScr.life-cyrus.001.0051",
      "source_sha256": "f229e5a880b803c8",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 15,
      "text": "As for me, I went out to the brothers, Apa Pamun and Apa Hierax. I told them what I had seen, and they gave glory to God."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/life_cyrus#CopScr.life-cyrus.001.0052",
      "source_sha256": "1f6a105ddc168cc2",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 12,
      "text": "But I stayed with them for a few days."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/life_cyrus#CopScr.life-cyrus.001.0053",
      "source_sha256": "cfc530ece7ff01a9",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 12,
      "text": "After this, I went to my monastery in Scetis and wrote the life of the blessed Apa Cyrus."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/life_cyrus#CopScr.life-cyrus.001.0054",
      "source_sha256": "cccebb1327f30bee",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 12,
      "text": "I left it in the church of Scetis for the benefit and comfort of those who would hear it, to the glory of the Holy Trinity—the Father, the Son, and the Holy Spirit—forever and ever. Amen. 7 ◈ 7 ◈ 7 ◈ 7 ◈ 7"
    }
  ]
}
